    <item>
      <title>Claude账号不用验证手机号的批量注册方法</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2392310</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2392310</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 04:19:58 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;Claude使用gmail或其他邮箱注册都会面临验证手机号的问题，对于想尝试Claude的佬来说很不友好。&lt;br&gt;
这个方法仅是免费账号的注册，前提条件是自己有一个域名，便宜的域名几块钱就可以注册一年。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/0/c/30cca0218e2af23b7912cf9cda1ec8ed5ba7a491.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/6XHkfUjBI78vo8MbK2N09Qcq9rP.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;0b6ae73e-4d7f-4f14-87dd-0bdf247322fc&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/0/c/30cca0218e2af23b7912cf9cda1ec8ed5ba7a491_2_690x302.png&quot; alt=&quot;0b6ae73e-4d7f-4f14-87dd-0bdf247322fc&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;6XHkfUjBI78vo8MbK2N09Qcq9rP&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;302&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/0/c/30cca0218e2af23b7912cf9cda1ec8ed5ba7a491_2_690x302.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/0/c/30cca0218e2af23b7912cf9cda1ec8ed5ba7a491_2_1035x453.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/0/c/30cca0218e2af23b7912cf9cda1ec8ed5ba7a491_2_1380x604.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F8F8F9&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
把域名托管到cloudflare，通过电子邮件服务的路由功能启用全收规则，然后设置一个接收邮箱，这样不需要一个一个添加邮件地址。&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/8/a/08aad202693b678d0788ae00f5aaa6206ae3d947.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/1eFNDN2Wglnkd6KzGlDKJRUYFTh.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/8/a/08aad202693b678d0788ae00f5aaa6206ae3d947_2_525x500.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;1eFNDN2Wglnkd6KzGlDKJRUYFTh&quot; width=&quot;525&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/8/a/08aad202693b678d0788ae00f5aaa6206ae3d947_2_525x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/8/a/08aad202693b678d0788ae00f5aaa6206ae3d947.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/8/a/08aad202693b678d0788ae00f5aaa6206ae3d947.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;252524&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
开启无痕模式，打开Claude官网，写入邮箱地址  XXX@你的域名，XXX随便填写，因为设置了全收规则，所以@前面随便写，所有注册验证邮件都会转到你设置的同一个接收邮箱。&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;25 个帖子 - 21 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2392310&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
